# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local.

# Optional. Without it, the GitHub integration works fine but is capped at
# GitHub's unauthenticated rate limit (60 requests/hour, shared across all
# visitors hitting an uncached revalidation). A token raises that to
# 5,000/hour. A classic PAT with no scopes selected ("public repo read"
# access) is enough — this app only ever reads public repository data and
# explicitly filters out private repos regardless of token scope.
#
# Never expose this to the client: it must NOT be prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
